#
#
#
#
#
#
# ▶ HINTS
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#   Right now the sidebands are at 436 and 444 Hz. Where do
#   those numbers come from?
#
#
#
#
#
#
#
#   440 - rate and 440 + rate. You need them 40 Hz away.
